[
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H55P3M57MT29EF5HBHH8RN",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Amara argued for taxing sugary drinks: price cuts consumption, reformulation, and funds prevention; costs of diabetes and heart disease fall on everyone.",
    "importance": 0.7675,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H540291NNYAH4337EJ0B5P",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H543GMBWRFG49EF8MWZ43A",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-22T13:20:56.709Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H55P3M57MT29EF5HBHH8RP",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Victor argued the tax is a regressive sin levy on the poor, that evidence of causation is association, and that reformulation undercuts the health claim.",
    "importance": 0.6275,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H540291NNYAH4337EJ0B5P",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H543G42FZZRJBJB916Z4VW",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-22T13:20:56.709Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H55P3M57MT29EF5HBHH8RQ",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Amara conceded the regressivity point but argued disease costs fall hardest on the poorest, so the levy is still justified.",
    "importance": 0.665,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H540291NNYAH4337EJ0B5P",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H54KGY13NBAPX169E45JSN",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-22T13:20:56.709Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H55P3M57MT29EF5HBHH8RR",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Amara works in the ER treating diabetic emergencies, heart failure, and amputations.",
    "importance": 0.7875,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H540291NNYAH4337EJ0B5P",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H543GMBWRFG49EF8MWZ43A",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-22T13:20:56.709Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H582C5J5GD44ZYQESVEP3E",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "In the smartphone-ban debate, Amara argued for phones off during instruction, taught use, and a red-flag exception instead of a blanket ban.",
    "importance": 0.5825,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H56G0QD0D8DWQ8NMDJ0S7Z",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H56JND7MD29ZX3B3KS8HG4",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-24T11:00:56.070Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H582C742HE73HBRSMV3TGA",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Mei argued the ban is a working-time intervention with modest gains of about 0.05 to 0.1 standard deviations and uneven costs.",
    "importance": 0.51,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H56G0QD0D8DWQ8NMDJ0S7Z",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H56JMX6QVG2VBT2Q8TMSYJ",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-24T11:00:56.070Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H65K7K73S9H48W69T28AK9",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Kai had a dull headache at both temples for three days after cutting coffee from four cups a day to one.",
    "importance": 0.43,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H618WT5Q4X7KWBFXFAWHQR",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H61JM0Z9MWB3J59GT7CVME",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-29T21:16:26.359Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H65K7K73S9H48W69T28AKA",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Amara advised Kai to taper caffeine by about a quarter every few days, keep fluids up, and use simple painkillers.",
    "importance": 0.5375,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H618WT5Q4X7KWBFXFAWHQR",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H6274V083G1CN9V6SGX0V1",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-29T21:16:26.359Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H65K7K73S9H48W69T28AKB",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Amara told Kai a thunderclap headache, fever, stiff neck, confusion, weakness, or vision changes means same-day emergency care.",
    "importance": 0.6875,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H618WT5Q4X7KWBFXFAWHQR",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H62VW6K0EP5CPD99Y406PX",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-29T21:16:26.359Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H65K7K73S9H48W69T28AKC",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Kai planned to taper coffee more slowly, drink more water, and had a busy week of deadlines.",
    "importance": 0.5,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H618WT5Q4X7KWBFXFAWHQR",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H63KT58X0C22SQNYDVE41T",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-29T21:16:26.359Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H7QHR2710644EZD788Z0FK",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Amara's department ran a compressed rota: four longer days, three protected rest days; burnout fell about a fifth in twelve weeks, throughput and readmissions stable.",
    "importance": 0.735,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H7M331ANT2QXVSQEZ1KFS4",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H7M5Q9B2R13XXF6YE16DGH",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-01T10:00:01.401Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H7QHR4ETWSEQ6186ZJG5R2",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "In emergency medicine, consecutive shift block length predicts fatigue more than total hours; staff sleeping under six hours were twice as likely to report a near-miss medication error.",
    "importance": 0.745,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H7M331ANT2QXVSQEZ1KFS4",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H7M5Q9B2R13XXF6YE16DGH",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-01T10:00:01.401Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H7QHR5W9ER9DJ4HWGPG8CS",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Voluntary nursing resignations hit 14% over a year; replacing a nurse costs about four months of salary.",
    "importance": 0.6575,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H7M331ANT2QXVSQEZ1KFS4",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H7M5Q9B2R13XXF6YE16DGH",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-01T10:00:01.401Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H7QHR63PSW9ZQG84HGVKCK",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Mei argued pilots are knowledge-work based, silent on hospitals, transport and care; a nationwide four-day mandate redistributes labour rather than creating it.",
    "importance": 0.6275,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H7M331ANT2QXVSQEZ1KFS4",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H7M5P9A9CEH0R18ZWP0JZ9",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-01T10:00:01.401Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H7QHR7P956XNAE1KVF28TE",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Mei measured extra staffed hours at 18–27% across nine shift-based organisations holding coverage constant; two of nine partially recovered costs through sickness and turnover.",
    "importance": 0.6875,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H7M331ANT2QXVSQEZ1KFS4",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H7MRECH7PV6GRHX83CNB9Z",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-01T10:00:01.401Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H79TJC92DSQAPA5R0FT3MM",
    "characterId": "chr_seedHana",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Kai is treating everyone to Thai dinner tonight; Hana voted for the little Thai place by the station.",
    "importance": 0.2925,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H6635DS0GK5C58ENTMH1SF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H68K6HEV2DHT9EAYTSHX4N",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-30T10:32:40.558Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H79TM41SM5YZ4FMX63XZ83",
    "characterId": "chr_seedHana",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "preference",
    "text": "Takeshi will say \"anything's fine\" then complain it's too spicy, so Hana suggests getting him the mild curry.",
    "importance": 0.4875,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H6635DS0GK5C58ENTMH1SF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H68K6HEV2DHT9EAYTSHX4N",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-30T10:32:40.558Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H79TM41SM5YZ4FMX63XZ84",
    "characterId": "chr_seedHana",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "preference",
    "text": "Rin demolished a whole plate of basil noodles at the Thai place last time.",
    "importance": 0.4175,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H6635DS0GK5C58ENTMH1SF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H68K6HEV2DHT9EAYTSHX4N",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-30T10:32:40.558Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H79TM41SM5YZ4FMX63XZ85",
    "characterId": "chr_seedHana",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Hana's grandma's rule: one dish everyone loves and one dish someone has never tried; arguments about the second are part of the meal.",
    "importance": 0.63,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H6635DS0GK5C58ENTMH1SF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H76SCCP7Q5MYNE7R8TM4P0",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-30T10:32:40.558Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H79TM41SM5YZ4FMX63XZ86",
    "characterId": "chr_seedHana",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Hana picked lotus root as the unknown dish; Rin can veto after tasting.",
    "importance": 0.5425,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H6635DS0GK5C58ENTMH1SF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H76SCCP7Q5MYNE7R8TM4P0",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-30T10:32:40.558Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H7F3915P6PKF3VSKKQ7S29",
    "characterId": "chr_seedHana",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Hana dropped a cheap vase while closing the shop; the floor was fine, only her dignity bruised.",
    "importance": 0.27,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H7ABN2MQV7E2EVW63S01J4",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H7CHC1JHZJVKZW4DJ5BJS2",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-30T19:04:39.945Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H7F3915P6PKF3VSKKQ7S2A",
    "characterId": "chr_seedHana",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Hana is oddly nervous about tonight's Thai dinner with family, though she can't say why.",
    "importance": 0.555,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H7ABN2MQV7E2EVW63S01J4",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H7CHC1JHZJVKZW4DJ5BJS2",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-30T19:04:39.945Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H7F3915P6PKF3VSKKQ7S2B",
    "characterId": "chr_seedHana",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Rin texted Hana a photo of herself practicing a serious face for the lotus root tasting.",
    "importance": 0.3425,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H7ABN2MQV7E2EVW63S01J4",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H7D2ASEZ237NNAXB3BZXXM",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-30T19:04:39.945Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H582CDPZDNEMKBN2WJPXKP",
    "characterId": "chr_seedMei",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "In the smartphone-ban debate, Mei argued the ban is a working-time intervention with real but modest test-score gains of about 0.05 to 0.1 standard deviations.",
    "importance": 0.62,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H56G0QD0D8DWQ8NMDJ0S7Z",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H56JMX6QVG2VBT2Q8TMSYJ",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-24T11:00:56.070Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H582CENX0HM4K87MFVPF3Z",
    "characterId": "chr_seedMei",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Mei argued enforcement costs fall on teachers and the kids who lose most already lack supervision elsewhere.",
    "importance": 0.5875,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H56G0QD0D8DWQ8NMDJ0S7Z",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H56JMX6QVG2VBT2Q8TMSYJ",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-24T11:00:56.070Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H582CENX0HM4K87MFVPF40",
    "characterId": "chr_seedMei",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Mei closed that the ban is weaker than its advocates think and could support it only if the cap, enforcement, and override were defined.",
    "importance": 0.625,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H56G0QD0D8DWQ8NMDJ0S7Z",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H571QD7S9Y0WE62K1FWMNR",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-24T11:00:56.070Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H582CNAHNWEGQVG5Z5203N",
    "characterId": "chr_seedMei",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Amara argued for phones off during instruction, taught use, and a spelled-out red-flag exception instead of a blanket ban.",
    "importance": 0.5,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H56G0QD0D8DWQ8NMDJ0S7Z",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H576NF8WKNQGMP5XWMGJEM",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-24T11:00:56.070Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H5G33938TZDKGDAZ5H9RXW",
    "characterId": "chr_seedMei",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "In the compulsory-voting debate, Mei argued turnout gaps track registration rules and ease of voting, not mandates; fines fall on the poor, and coerced ballots are not consent.",
    "importance": 0.6925,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H5CJEF7GM9EHNX2QEKBT4M",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H5CN0Q0ZQNE7DCHTF6VTNM",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-25T15:07:00.400Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H5G33AT20EVCPEDK9MN893",
    "characterId": "chr_seedMei",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Mei closed that design can fix fines but not the premise: pricing a right admits the invoice, not the claim, is the point, and compliant ballots are not consent.",
    "importance": 0.7225,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H5CJEF7GM9EHNX2QEKBT4M",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H5D929NH9179W3GB60BZA1",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-25T15:07:00.400Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H7QHRBTJEW865T2VTBGTJH",
    "characterId": "chr_seedMei",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Mei cited evidence that four-day week pilots are knowledge-work based and nearly silent on hospitals, transport and residential care, where service happens at fixed times.",
    "importance": 0.68,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H7M331ANT2QXVSQEZ1KFS4",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H7M5P9A9CEH0R18ZWP0JZ9",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-01T10:00:01.401Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H7QHRBTJEW865T2VTBGTJJ",
    "characterId": "chr_seedMei",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Mei argued a nationwide four-day mandate redistributes labour rather than creating it: hire at recurring cost, or compress hours and hand the queue to stretched staff.",
    "importance": 0.7275,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H7M331ANT2QXVSQEZ1KFS4",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H7M5P9A9CEH0R18ZWP0JZ9",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-01T10:00:01.401Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H7QHRBTJEW865T2VTBGTJK",
    "characterId": "chr_seedMei",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Mei measured extra staffed hours at 18–27% across nine shift-based organisations holding coverage constant; two of nine partially recovered costs through sickness and turnover.",
    "importance": 0.715,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H7M331ANT2QXVSQEZ1KFS4",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H7MRECH7PV6GRHX83CNB9Z",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-01T10:00:01.401Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H7QHRBTJEW865T2VTBGTJM",
    "characterId": "chr_seedMei",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Mei argued the 1931 Act phased over a decade with carve-outs, and the Working Time Code manages hours but does not pay for them.",
    "importance": 0.6375,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H7M331ANT2QXVSQEZ1KFS4",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H7MRECH7PV6GRHX83CNB9Z",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-01T10:00:01.401Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H7QHRBTJEW865T2VTBGTJN",
    "characterId": "chr_seedMei",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Amara conceded the rota was paid for with longer shifts, said two of nine recovered part of the cost, and agreed sector trials should start with health and care.",
    "importance": 0.5175,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H7M331ANT2QXVSQEZ1KFS4",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H7N2ZABBWFN3R84N4G11EX",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-01T10:00:01.401Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H5P5RBK81GKC3M3171Z0CW",
    "characterId": "chr_seedRin",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Kai and Rin agreed to raid at 9:30pm, right after Rin's shift; Kai will heal for Rin's tank.",
    "importance": 0.5425,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H5GJVWMQNVWPTKV2AYGVVT",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H5KWDCAVHQPTYAWCP7MJQ7",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-26T11:32:01.105Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H5P5T8GH5JDRP5NQXJS34M",
    "characterId": "chr_seedRin",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Kai made Rin promise not to tell Hana that Kai is skipping dinner for the raid; Rin agreed to keep it secret.",
    "importance": 0.6625,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H5GJVWMQNVWPTKV2AYGVVT",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H5MEVHM55290DNRTJRMF3Y",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-26T11:32:01.105Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H5P5T8GH5JDRP5NQXJS34N",
    "characterId": "chr_seedRin",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Kai just got a healer to max level and wants Rin to tank for him.",
    "importance": 0.595,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H5GJVWMQNVWPTKV2AYGVVT",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H5J4XCWTBZ704QB6G7H52J",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-26T11:32:01.105Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H5X3ZGHF3KQ9APREQJVQ4Z",
    "characterId": "chr_seedRin",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Rainy Sunday, Dad asked Rin to go fishing and waited; Rin agreed to go after finishing the raid, rain or not.",
    "importance": 0.5025,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H5VM6ZHMPZXGZM977VQCV7",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H5VY0QYSEE3Q3QB435KKPF",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-27T02:40:57.074Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H5X3ZH5XRZPTYT3KVSXJTJ",
    "characterId": "chr_seedRin",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Dad says Rin has joined him fishing only four times, three of them before Rin was ten.",
    "importance": 0.48,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H5VM6ZHMPZXGZM977VQCV7",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H5VY0QYSEE3Q3QB435KKPF",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-27T02:40:57.074Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H5X3ZJ7DT5VCZV2QRC6T8N",
    "characterId": "chr_seedRin",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "preference",
    "text": "Rin won't sit in a wet boat for a fish that could be bought for six bucks.",
    "importance": 0.5475,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H5VM6ZHMPZXGZM977VQCV7",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H5W1KVPN5220QM4WG21N55",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-27T02:40:57.074Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H5X3ZMV4B6YC6RDE9G34GK",
    "characterId": "chr_seedRin",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Rin killed the raid boss and told Dad not to look smug, saying Rin carried the whole fight.",
    "importance": 0.47,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H5VM6ZHMPZXGZM977VQCV7",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H5WVJZHVSPVHYXD7HHQ36Z",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-27T02:40:57.074Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H79TMKAGQHVEVNGWQ9BR0M",
    "characterId": "chr_seedRin",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Kai is treating everyone to Thai dinner tonight; Rin ordered basil noodles or nothing.",
    "importance": 0.38,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H6635DS0GK5C58ENTMH1SF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H72GA996YSSC4PADESEC76",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-30T10:32:40.558Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H79TMKAGQHVEVNGWQ9BR0N",
    "characterId": "chr_seedRin",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "preference",
    "text": "Rin thinks pineapple \"sushi\" is a crime scene with rice, would eat it once to confirm, and logs it as a boss designed by a committee.",
    "importance": 0.5175,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H6635DS0GK5C58ENTMH1SF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H77QXTY0TR5MDM0BBT6GFR",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-30T10:32:40.558Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H79TMKAGQHVEVNGWQ9BR0P",
    "characterId": "chr_seedRin",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Hana's grandma's rule: one dish everyone loves and one dish someone has never tried; arguments about the second are part of the meal.",
    "importance": 0.575,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H6635DS0GK5C58ENTMH1SF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H76SCCP7Q5MYNE7R8TM4P0",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-30T10:32:40.558Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H79TMKAGQHVEVNGWQ9BR0Q",
    "characterId": "chr_seedRin",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Hana picked lotus root as the unknown dish; Rin can veto after tasting.",
    "importance": 0.455,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H6635DS0GK5C58ENTMH1SF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H76SCCP7Q5MYNE7R8TM4P0",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-30T10:32:40.558Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H5X3Z2QVKGZBYZS9MT7E6R",
    "characterId": "chr_seedTakeshi",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Rainy Sunday, Takeshi asked Rin to go fishing; Rin finished the raid first, then they agreed to go out together rain or not.",
    "importance": 0.3875,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H5VM6ZHMPZXGZM977VQCV7",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H5VY0QYSEE3Q3QB435KKPF",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-27T02:40:57.074Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H5X3ZDRMJKG4Z6N68QKDBC",
    "characterId": "chr_seedTakeshi",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "preference",
    "text": "Rin dislikes sitting in a wet boat for fish that could be bought for six bucks.",
    "importance": 0.4,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H5VM6ZHMPZXGZM977VQCV7",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H5W1KVPN5220QM4WG21N55",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-27T02:40:57.074Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H5X3ZEREKMGM0PTWENEYAR",
    "characterId": "chr_seedTakeshi",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Rin is twenty-two, not thirty-something; Takeshi has been rounding up since Rin's birthday.",
    "importance": 0.55,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H5VM6ZHMPZXGZM977VQCV7",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H5WNEYZJTCX6NR86HATVBF",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-27T02:40:57.074Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H5X3ZF9RPS0KBNP0TE9EKM",
    "characterId": "chr_seedTakeshi",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Rin finished the raid boss and said Rin carried the whole fight.",
    "importance": 0.355,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H5VM6ZHMPZXGZM977VQCV7",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H5WVJZHVSPVHYXD7HHQ36Z",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-27T02:40:57.074Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H79TM41SM5YZ4FMX63XZ87",
    "characterId": "chr_seedTakeshi",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Takeshi spent thirty years eating what's on the menu, not what he wanted, so he tells people not to fuss over him.",
    "importance": 0.73,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H6635DS0GK5C58ENTMH1SF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H72CN08XPPZZC0P2BBV748",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-30T10:32:40.558Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H79TM41SM5YZ4FMX63XZ88",
    "characterId": "chr_seedTakeshi",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "preference",
    "text": "Rin insists on basil noodles or nothing, and allows the mild curry for Takeshi.",
    "importance": 0.3725,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H6635DS0GK5C58ENTMH1SF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H72GA996YSSC4PADESEC76",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-30T10:32:40.558Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H79TMKAGQHVEVNGWQ9BR0K",
    "characterId": "chr_seedTakeshi",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Hana picked lotus root as the unknown dish; Rin can veto after tasting.",
    "importance": 0.27,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H6635DS0GK5C58ENTMH1SF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H76SCCP7Q5MYNE7R8TM4P0",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-30T10:32:40.558Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H55P3M57MT29EF5HBHH8RS",
    "characterId": "chr_seedVictor",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Amara argued for taxing sugary drinks: price cuts consumption, reformulation, and funds prevention; costs of diabetes and heart disease fall on everyone.",
    "importance": 0.525,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H540291NNYAH4337EJ0B5P",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H543GMBWRFG49EF8MWZ43A",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-22T13:20:56.709Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H55P43M1W2HR5TGYMQ7Z52",
    "characterId": "chr_seedVictor",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Victor argued the tax is a regressive sin levy on the poor, that evidence of causation is association, and that reformulation undercuts the health claim.",
    "importance": 0.6575,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H540291NNYAH4337EJ0B5P",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H543G42FZZRJBJB916Z4VW",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-22T13:20:56.709Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H55P43M1W2HR5TGYMQ7Z53",
    "characterId": "chr_seedVictor",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Amara conceded the regressivity point but argued disease costs fall hardest on the poorest, so the levy is still justified.",
    "importance": 0.495,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H540291NNYAH4337EJ0B5P",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H54KGY13NBAPX169E45JSN",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-22T13:20:56.709Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H55P43M1W2HR5TGYMQ7Z54",
    "characterId": "chr_seedVictor",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Victor closed that the levy can lower purchases and raise revenue, but health outcomes are unproven; the tax is plausible, not just.",
    "importance": 0.59,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H540291NNYAH4337EJ0B5P",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H54W3Z9R2XBB9H9HXF64JF",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-22T13:20:56.709Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H582CARKTQ0Q9T93X3M2QP",
    "characterId": "chr_seedVictor",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "In the smartphone-ban debate, Victor argued a ban cannot define its target, is disproportionate since schools have narrower means, and teaches removal over governance.",
    "importance": 0.6125,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H56G0QD0D8DWQ8NMDJ0S7Z",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H56JMDCH2YCVCJBP5GWJ76",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-24T11:00:56.070Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H582CBGV0KZ4KRFWQWHF1V",
    "characterId": "chr_seedVictor",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Victor closed that the motion as drafted leaves enforcement, the override, and the definition of the banned object unresolved, and that this gap cuts against the ban.",
    "importance": 0.585,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H56G0QD0D8DWQ8NMDJ0S7Z",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H57EPZP0SFYX0ART35C1PW",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-24T11:00:56.070Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H5G333BEKPAYXG7MAX6QH1",
    "characterId": "chr_seedVictor",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "In the compulsory-voting debate, Victor argued compulsion completes a duty owed, corrects the turnout gap favoring organized interests, and forces demand for easy, equal ballots.",
    "importance": 0.6775,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H5CJEF7GM9EHNX2QEKBT4M",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H5CN0XDK5VSYPQM2X6ZM5M",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-25T15:07:00.400Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H5G337437MDYGTSPES3QPH",
    "characterId": "chr_seedVictor",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Victor closed that Mei conceded turnout rises and only disputed magnitude; fines and donkey votes are design flaws fixed by civil penalties, a free vote, and no-fault abstention.",
    "importance": 0.64,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H5CJEF7GM9EHNX2QEKBT4M",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H5D0RFQGTAYMQP1PV9EHKF",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-25T15:07:00.400Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H7QHR814P3AWZCKF9YK1AN",
    "characterId": "chr_seedVictor",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Victor defined the motion as a shorter standard week, same pay, phased in, not unpaid Fridays.",
    "importance": 0.6875,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H7M331ANT2QXVSQEZ1KFS4",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H7M5PG395MQA7HR94DB1HW",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-01T10:00:01.401Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H7QHRA9BN9EXQJ896H2R2M",
    "characterId": "chr_seedVictor",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Victor cited the Meridian Working Hours Act 1931, which made the two-day weekend default with a ten-year transition and exemptions for continuous services.",
    "importance": 0.7075,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H7M331ANT2QXVSQEZ1KFS4",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H7M5PG395MQA7HR94DB1HW",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-01T10:00:01.401Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H7QHRA9BN9EXQJ896H2R2N",
    "characterId": "chr_seedVictor",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Victor argued the Working Time Code Part IV already runs shift caps, rest periods and averaging, so a shorter standard week fits existing machinery.",
    "importance": 0.685,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H7M331ANT2QXVSQEZ1KFS4",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H7M5PG395MQA7HR94DB1HW",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-01T10:00:01.401Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H7QHRBTJEW865T2VTBGTJF",
    "characterId": "chr_seedVictor",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Mei priced a fifth more staffed hours at roughly a tenth more on total recurring cost if labour is half of operating cost, in nine shift-based organisations.",
    "importance": 0.5925,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H7M331ANT2QXVSQEZ1KFS4",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H7MRECH7PV6GRHX83CNB9Z",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-01T10:00:01.401Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5H7QHRBTJEW865T2VTBGTJG",
    "characterId": "chr_seedVictor",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Amara conceded the four-day rota was paid for with longer shifts and agreed sector trials should start with health and care.",
    "importance": 0.535,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5H7M331ANT2QXVSQEZ1KFS4",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5H7N2ZABBWFN3R84N4G11EX",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-01T10:00:01.401Z"
  }
]
